WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
[Electronic music] The upright robot appears in profile. The view starts to move closer.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.800
Optical Head appears beside the scan. The paired optics turn slowly in close-up.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.000
The scan recedes. Full Chassis identifies the closing view.
